-- 7. Settle — the structure comes to rest. Tempo back to 92.
-- ~40 cycles (~104 s at 92 BPM).

setbpm 92

-- clear the snap's trumpet and metal sparkles
fadeSilence 8 [8,9]

d1 kickSoft
d2 brush
d3 ride
d6 bassSettle
xfadeIn 4 16 compSettle

-- a bluesy piano answer, sparse
xfadeIn 5 32 motifSettle

-- the reed returns for one phrase
xfadeIn 7 32 reedCall

-- no trumpet here; let the room do the sparkle
